  "description": "charlesw/tesseract's .NET wrapper for Tesseract OCR, built from a\n      patched fork (jbtule/tesseract#arm64-platform-detection) so\n      TesseractEnviornment.CustomSearchPath checks the exact path you give\n      it instead of always nesting an inferred platform subfolder underneath\n      it, and so arm64 processes are correctly detected instead of reported\n      as x64. Depends on Tesseract.Native, so installing this one package\n      restores the matching native binaries for whichever of\n      win-x64/win-arm64/linux-x64/osx-arm64 you're building for.\n\n      API-compatible drop-in replacement for the stock Tesseract package --\n      same namespace and types. Install this INSTEAD OF Tesseract, not\n      alongside it.",
  "id": "Tesseract.CrossPlatform",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-06T06:34:17.263Z",
